# results/*.log is analysis provenance, not build noise. These are the verbatim
# run output of the panel pass and of the two §3.10 diagnostics, and they are
# the only record of what produced the committed tables beside them. The *.log
# rule above silently dropped three of them from be4079e, which `git status`
# could not show because an ignored file is not a change. This negation records
# the intent in the repository rather than bypassing the rule per-file.
!results/*.log

!results/**/*.log
!results/**/*.json
